Since we're beating this issue to death, I imagine someone will sum the
infinite series 1/3 + 1/3(1/5 + 1/25 + 1/125 + ...). It's roughly 0.4166
(that's the average number of items per room).  So 4% * 0.5% * 0.4166 of
rooms contain WOW's directly (1/12000) and 8% * 0.1625 * 6% * 0.5% * 0.4166
of rooms contain WOW's within containers (1/615000).  

So the total is 1/11800 random rooms contains a WOW.

